    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I'm trying to build a custom `statuscolumn` & wanted to show the diff signs, but when I call `sign_getplaced` on a modified line it doesn't return the diff signs. I have explicitly set `view.style = 'sign'`\r\n\r\nThis is how I'm quickly testing this \r\n\r\n```vim\r\n:echo sign_getplaced(bufname(), {'group': '*', 'lnum': v:lnum})\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo how can I get signs added by `mini.diff`?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'm trying to build a custom <code class=\"notranslate\">statuscolumn</code> &amp; wanted to show the diff signs, but when I call <code class=\"notranslate\">sign_getplaced</code> on a modified line it doesn't return the diff signs. I have explicitly set <code class=\"notranslate\">view.style = 'sign'</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is how I'm quickly testing this</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-viml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\":echo sign_getplaced(bufname(), {'group': '*', 'lnum': v:lnum})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">:<span class=\"pl-c1\">echo</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">sign_getplaced</span>(<span class=\"pl-en\">bufname</span>(), {<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>group<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>*<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>lnum<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\"><span class=\"pl-k\">v:</span>lnum</span>})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So how can I get signs added by <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.diff</code>?</p>",
    "bodyText": "I'm trying to build a custom statuscolumn & wanted to show the diff signs, but when I call sign_getplaced on a modified line it doesn't return the diff signs. I have explicitly set view.style = 'sign'\nThis is how I'm quickly testing this\n:echo sign_getplaced(bufname(), {'group': '*', 'lnum': v:lnum})\nSo how can I get signs added by mini.diff?",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
